  "bodyHash": "pWz+eQxdOuU=",
  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/headings/treasure2_title2.png\" width=\"600px\"></p><div>&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Treasure2</strong> 為 Minecraft 的探索體驗增添了更多刺激。這個模組新增了各種稀有寶箱等待玩家發現。這些寶箱配備了多種鎖具，必須找到對應的鑰匙才能開啟。</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/headings/news_title.png\" width=\"129\" height=\"48\"></div><div><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magic-treasures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/magic_treasures_news.png\" width=\"1028\" height=\"324\"></a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div>&nbsp;</div><div><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/headings/treasure2_divider.png\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/requirements.png\" alt=\"需求\" width=\"1028\" height=\"87\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gottschcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/wiki/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Magic-Treasures/images/curseforge/gottschcore-logo-curseforge.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></p><div>&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"font-size:24px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gottschcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GottschCore</a></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/headings/treasure2_divider.png\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><p><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/headings/chests_title.png\" width=\"158\" height=\"48\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/chests.png\" alt=\"可發現各種形狀與尺寸的寶箱。每個寶箱具有不同的稀有度，這決定了其生成機率與寶藏品質。\"></p><div>&nbsp;</div><p><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/headings/keys_locks_title.png\" width=\"260\" height=\"48\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/keys_locks.png\" alt=\"各式鎖具保護著寶箱，阻擋你取得戰利品。你需要找到對應的鑰匙才能開啟。\"></p><div>&nbsp;</div><div><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/headings/coins_gems_title.png\" width=\"254\" height=\"48\"></div><div><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/coins_gems.png\"> 你可以使用小袋來存放多餘的鑰匙、鎖具、硬幣與寶石。鑰匙圈可容納多把鑰匙，並能像單把鑰匙般自動從庫存中選取正確的鑰匙開鎖。</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/headings/wishing_wells_title.png\" width=\"331\" height=\"48\"></div><div><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/wishing_wells.png\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/headings/weapons_title.png\" width=\"217\" height=\"48\"></div><div>無需建立完整子模組，<strong>Treasure2</strong> 便新增了一套新武器，包含標準版與收藏版。這些武器設計貼近原版遊戲，不會過於強勢。<br><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/weapons.png\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/headings/mimics_title.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"48\"></div><div>寶箱怪強勢回歸！重新設計的模型與5種新型寶箱怪（紙箱型、板條箱型、發霉板條箱型、維京型與大釜型）。 <img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/mimics.png\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/headings/addon_mods.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"297\" height=\"48\"></div><div>你可以輕鬆為 <strong>Treasure2</strong> 製作擴充模組。以下列出部分範例：</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diamethysts-t2-loot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/headings/diamethysts_t2_loot_title3.png\" width=\"357\" height=\"100\"></a></span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/treasure2-twilight-forest-loot-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Treasure2: 暮光森林戰利品包</a></span> - 由 gottsch 製作</div><div>&nbsp;</div><p><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/headings/datapacks_title.png\" width=\"251\" height=\"48\"><br><strong>Treasure2</strong> 可作為獨立模組使用，但原版物品能作為優質戰利品的選擇有限。本模組特別設計可使用資料包來填充寶箱戰利品表。以下是用於 Treasure2 的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮光森林</a> 資料包：<br><br></p><p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/treasure2/files/4608803\" rel=\"nofollow\">treasure2-twilight-forest-datapack_v1.0.0.zip</a></p><p>你可以檢視此範例，了解如何為 Treasure2 設定任何資料包。</p><div>&nbsp;</div><div>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/headings/modpacks_title.png\" width=\"234\" height=\"48\"><br>答案是<strong>可以</strong>。歡迎隨意在你的模組包中使用 Treasure2 或我的任何模組。</p>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/headings/reviews_title.png\" width=\"193\" height=\"48\"></p>\n</div><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540louisetherose%252fvideo%252f7277901152363056391\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.tiktok.com/@louisetherose/video/7277901152363056391</a></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Q0jsWnC5pxE\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/x9KLTYVFgkw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nodBRlkbekI\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oUiDivI_yGk?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7nRUHqzxBNI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/PqRd9Zg6rGw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Es9O6bQL-mU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cQf0OdhXY84?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div>&nbsp;</div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Treasure/wiki/images/curseforge/headings/treasure2_divider.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/CpWXamx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WlrSbJp.png\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgottsch\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Gwa8kuz.png\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/gottschsmods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/se1ERhJ.png\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.amazon.com/hz/wishlist/ls/31YQP9T4H9NI7?ref_=wl_share\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EcaUQMi.png\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fgottsch\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/39o2rdL.png\"></a></p>\n</div>",
